      "Team leaders can now change the team page photo. Previously only mentors and admins could set the team banner photo; a team leader can now upload or change it right from the team page without being able to edit the rest of the profile. This is a new role permission, “Change Team Page Photo” (Teams group in Admin → Role Management), granted to the Team Leader role by default — grant it to any other role there if you'd like. The rest of the Edit Profile form stays mentor/admin-only.",
      "Development Program (FDP) roster: you can now open a graduated youth's Board of Review record. The Graduated list gained a record button (like the active roster has) that opens their development record — the board-of-review outcome, date, panel, notes, and rubric scores — so you can look back at the feedback after a youth has graduated. (Their member profile's FDP pane already showed this; the roster's Graduated section previously only offered “Undo graduation.”)",
